One Small Technical Observation

The report states:

"PQC-Ready Component ... 2 of 66 (3%)."

Since 2 ÷ 66 ≈ 3.03%, consider displaying one decimal place (e.g., 3.0%) consistently throughout the report. It is a minor refinement, but it conveys numerical precision in enterprise reporting.

